"text":"司馬彪序傳曰：朗祖父雋，字元異，博學好古，倜儻有大度。長八尺三寸，腰帶十圍，儀狀魁岸，與眾有異，鄉黨宗族咸景附焉。位至穎川太守。父防，字建公，性質直公方，雖閑居宴處，威儀不忒。雅好《漢書名臣列傳》，所諷誦者數十萬言。少仕州郡，歷官洛陽令、京兆尹，以年老轉拜騎都尉。養志閭巷，闔門自守。諸子雖冠成人，不命曰進不敢進，不命曰坐不敢坐，不指有所問不敢言，父子之間肅如也。年七十一，建安二十四年終。有子八人，朗最長，次即晉宣皇帝也。","text_layer":"witness_peisongzhi_quoted_simabiao_xuzhuan","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-015-pei-simabiao-xuzhuan:line023-pei-note:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"司馬彪","kind":"person","person_id":"0ac_8a3_8a3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本段上下文辨識；不據同名強併。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-015-pei-simabiao-xuzhuan:line023-pei-note:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"朗","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本段上下文辨識；不據同名強併。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-015-pei-simabiao-xuzhuan:line023-pei-note:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"雋","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本段上下文辨識；不據同名強併。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-015-pei-simabiao-xuzhuan:line023-pei-note:m0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"元異","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本段上下文辨識；不據同名強併。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-015-pei-simabiao-xuzhuan:line023-pei-note:m0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"眾","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"群體或代詞需依上下文；不補未名母親、子女或同名人物。","unresolved_kind":"source_unresolved_person_or_group"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-015-pei-simabiao-xuzhuan:line023-pei-note:m0048","start":48,"end":52,"surface":"鄉黨宗族","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"群體或代詞需依上下文；不補未名母親、子女或同名人物。","unresolved_kind":"source_unresolved_person_or_group"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-015-pei-simabiao-xuzhuan:line023-pei-note:m0065","start":65,"end":66,"surface":"防","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本段上下文辨識；不據同名強併。"}